links rewrites the [[slug]] wikilinks in one markdown document into ordinary markdown links: each citation targets the path a caller-supplied --map names for its slug, or, given no map, the cited document's path relative to the document being rewritten. Unlike refs, which reports what cites what, links emits one document with its citations rewritten.

Usage:
  specs links <path> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help         help for links
      --map string   path to a YAML link map resolving corpus slugs to link targets

Global Flags:
      --config string   path to the repository's specs.toml (default "specs.toml")
